pve-ext (0.2.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * The manifest id, the .claimed-by marker, the manifest-id subcommand and
    the no-stacking refusal are gone; a file another package has diverted is
    still refused. A leftover marker is ignored. Tabs are no longer gated on
    capabilities, and the iframe page form is gone: every page is a script
    with an xtype. A page manifest is checked for the fields the loader needs
    and skipped with a warning otherwise.

 -- Julius Arkenberg <julius@rkenberg.de>  Thu, 18 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200

pve-ext (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: PVE::API2::Ext (API-module discovery), pve-ext-loader.js
    (UI-page discovery) and pve-ext-patch (generic managed-patch tool),
    plus pve-ext's own two-file pve-manager patch manifest.

 -- Julius Arkenberg <julius@rkenberg.de>  Mon, 07 Sep 2026 12:00:00 -0000
